    "description": "Evo Picatinny AFG V1.2.1: Laffs Dynamics\n\nAn angled foregrip designed specifically to match up to the OEM CZ Scorpion Evo III Pistol/SMG handguard. \nUtilizes the entire bottom picatinny rail on the handguard. Has front and rear hand stops, also has ridges \nthat wrap around the AFG. \n\n(Can be used on other weapon picatinny handguards)\n\n\nUpdate V1.2.1: Tightened picatinny rail slot tolerances. Thickened handstops ends by 2mm. Relabeled designer's brand.\n\n\nPrinter Used: Monoprice Maker Select Plus\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C \nBed: 54C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .18mm \nStandard Layer Height: .14mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 4 - 5\nInfill: 25%\nInfill Pattern: Gyroid\nMaterial Flow: 100%\nSupport Material Percentage: 20%\n\n\nHardware Required:\n\n1x M4x30mm Bolt (Can be ground down to 28mm so it doesn't stick out the side)\n\n1x M4 Hex Nut",
